  "placement": "Book page 43, topic 2.6: ত্বরণ (Acceleration). Next to the paragraph on a winding path and চিত্র ২.০৫ (a stone whirled on a string): at the same speed, a change of direction is ত্বরণ too; after the acceleration lab.",
  "order": 2,
  "maintainers": ["RadeenXALNW"],
  "units": "m",
  "description": "Acceleration at a steady speed (ত্বরণ, page 43, 2.6): the book says every turn on a winding path changes the বেগ even at সমদ্রুতি, so it is ত্বরণ. A CNG auto-rickshaw goes at a steady 2.5 m/s on open sand (striped, nothing else); the student turns it with বাঁয়ে and ডানে (press and hold) on a 3 m circle. The speedometer stays at 2.5, but the blue বেগ arrow (and a compass in the panel) turns; while it turns, the circle and its middle (বাঁকের কেন্দ্র) are drawn, a purple ত্বরণ arrow points at that middle and the track turns purple; going straight, the track is grey and the label says ত্বরণ নেই. Seen from above, tilted, north up. Test: 3 tap questions (is turning at the same speed ত্বরণ; which way the ত্বরণ points; is going straight at the same speed ত্বরণ), each worked answer naming the mistake. Phone-first, Bangla. GLB: the CNG auto-rickshaw at real size, in metres.",
